        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Ferrero SpA\n- People: Pietro Ferrero\n- Products: Nutella\n- Places: Alba, Piedmont, Italy\n- Topics: chocolate and confectionery\n\nFacts:\n- Ferrero SpA was founded in 1946 in Alba, Piedmont, Italy, by Pietro Ferrero.\n- Pietro Ferrero was a confectioner and small-time pastry maker who laid the groundwork for Nutella.\n- Pietro Ferrero famously added hazelnut to chocolate to reduce costs.\n- Nutella’s first iteration dates to 1963.\n- Nutella is a brand of sweetened hazelnut cocoa spread manufactured by Ferrero.\n- Nutella was first introduced in 1965.\n- Ferrero SpA is an Italian manufacturer of branded chocolate and confectionery products.\n- Ferrero SpA is the third biggest chocolate producer and confectionery company in the world.",
